{
  "declaredLength": 2856,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "미르의 요리사들과 이야기를 해 보니\n이름이 자주 거론되시더군요...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n지프 씨는 대체 정체가 뭐죠?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974C7580020C694B9ACC0ACB4E4ACFC0020C774C57CAE30B97C0020D5740020BCF4B2C8000AC774B984C7740020C790C8FC0020AC70B860B418C2DCB354AD70C694002E002E002E00100001BE00000AC9C0D5040020C528B2940020B300CCB40020C815CCB4AC000020BB50C8E0003F00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저는 그저 미르에서 자란\n불량배에 불과합니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B2940020ADF8C8000020BBF8B974C5D0C11C0020C790B780000ABD88B7C9BC30C5D00020BD88ACFCD569B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "먹으면 없어질지라도\n보다 맛있게 만들기 위해 노력하는<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n어떤 요리사를 만난 뒤로<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA39C73CBA740020C5C6C5B4C9C8C9C0B77CB3C4000ABCF4B2E40020B9DBC788AC8C0020B9CCB4E4AE300020C704D5740020B178B825D558B29400100001BE00000AC5B4B5A40020C694B9ACC0ACB97C0020B9CCB09C0020B4A4B85C00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "열과 성을 다해 요리를 마주하게 됐다...\n단지 그뿐입니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5F4ACFC0020C131C7440020B2E4D5740020C694B9ACB97C0020B9C8C8FCD558AC8C0020B410B2E4002E002E002E000AB2E8C9C00020ADF8BFD0C785B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그쪽도 제법\n깐깐해 보이는 것 같던데 말이죠.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n크루아상의 굽기부터\n소금 간까지 하나같이 최고더군요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8CABDB3C40020C81CBC95000AAE50AE50D5740020BCF4C774B2940020AC830020AC19B358B3700020B9D0C774C8E0002E00100001BE01000AD06CB8E8C544C0C1C7580020AD7DAE30BD80D130000AC18CAE080020AC04AE4CC9C00020D558B098AC19C7740020CD5CACE0B354AD70C694002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "요리는 과학입니다.\n수치와 순서만 지키면 실패하지 않죠.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C694B9ACB2940020ACFCD559C785B2C8B2E4002E000AC218CE58C6400020C21CC11CB9CC0020C9C0D0A4BA740020C2E4D328D558C9C00020C54AC8E0002E00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬의 불꽃 기술을 1도 단위로\n조절할 수 있게 단련하기도 했구요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC7580020BD88AF430020AE30C220C74400200031B3C40020B2E8C704B85C000AC870C808D5600020C2180020C788AC8C0020B2E8B828D558AE30B3C40020D588AD6CC694002E00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "훌륭하십니다!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n그 기량만 봐도 당신이 얼마나\n강한 트레이너인지 잘 알겠군요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D6CCB96DD558C2EDB2C8B2E4002100100001BE01000AADF80020AE30B7C9B9CC0020BD10B3C40020B2F9C2E0C7740020C5BCB9C8B098000AAC15D55C0020D2B8B808C774B108C778C9C00020C7980020C54CACA0AD70C694002100100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "예! 화력은 승부에서도\n중요한 요소니까요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C60800210020D654B825C7400020C2B9BD80C5D0C11CB3C4000AC911C694D55C0020C694C18CB2C8AE4CC694002E00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "먹을 거에 그 정도로 집착할 필요 있어?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA39C7440020AC70C5D00020ADF80020C815B3C4B85C0020C9D1CC29D5600020D544C6940020C788C5B4003F00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "밥 같은 건 열심히 일하고 나서 먹으면\n뭐든 맛있게 먹을 수 있다고.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC250020AC19C7400020AC740020C5F4C2ECD7880020C77CD558ACE00020B098C11C0020BA39C73CBA74000ABB50B4E00020B9DBC788AC8C0020BA39C7440020C2180020C788B2E4ACE0002E00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그리젤!\n저와 같이 승부해 주시지 않겠습니까?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B9ACC8240021000AC800C6400020AC19C7740020C2B9BD80D5740020C8FCC2DCC9C00020C54AACA0C2B5B2C8AE4C003F00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋아. 승부를 하고 난 다음에\n먹는 밥도 맛있으니까.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC544002E0020C2B9BD80B97C0020D558ACE00020B09C0020B2E4C74CC5D0000ABA39B2940020BC25B3C40020B9DBC788C73CB2C8AE4C002E00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "당신은 저와 함께 싸워 주시죠.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2F9C2E0C7400020C800C6400020D568AED80020C2F8C6CC0020C8FCC2DCC8E0002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "물론이죠!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB3CB860C774C8E000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다려 주세요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B8240020C8FCC138C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "코트에서 기다리고 있을 테니\n부탁드리겠습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CF54D2B8C5D0C11C0020AE30B2E4B9ACACE00020C788C7440020D14CB2C8000ABD80D0C1B4DCB9ACACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "화끈한 승부를\n부탁드리겠습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D654B048D55C0020C2B9BD80B97C000ABD80D0C1B4DCB9ACACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지프 씨에게 감동을 선사할 수 있게\n포켓몬 승부를 해 주시죠!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0D5040020C528C5D0AC8C0020AC10B3D9C7440020C120C0ACD5600020C2180020C788AC8C000AD3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020D5740020C8FCC2DCC8E0002100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그리를 위해서라도\n승부에 어울려 줘.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B9ACB97C0020C704D574C11CB77CB3C4000AC2B9BD80C5D00020C5B4C6B8B8240020C918002E00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이길 거예요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774AE380020AC70C608C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기다려 주세요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30B2E4B8240020C8FCC138C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "마음속의 불씨를 가만둬서는 안 됩니다!\n더욱 크게 타올라야만 합니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9C8C74CC18DC7580020BD88C528B97C0020AC00B9CCB46CC11CB2940020C5480020B429B2C8B2E40021000AB354C6B10020D06CAC8C0020D0C0C62CB77CC57CB9CC0020D569B2C8B2E4002100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "리자몽! 흑염을 뿜어라!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9ACC790BABD00210020D751C5FCC7440020BFDCC5B4B77C002100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼 여긴 뭐 하러 온 거야...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC0020C5ECAE340020BB500020D558B7EC0020C6280020AC70C57C002E002E002E00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "불태워 주겠어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD88D0DCC6CC0020C8FCACA0C5B4002100100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "부탁드리겠습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD80D0C1B4DCB9ACACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "눈부실 정도로 불태우기 위해\n메가진화로 타올라라! 리자몽!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B208BD80C2E40020C815B3C4B85C0020BD88D0DCC6B0AE300020C704D574000ABA54AC00C9C4D654B85C0020D0C0C62CB77CB77C00210020B9ACC790BABD002100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "누보로서 새롭게 살기 위해\n목숨을 불사르는 메가진화를 보여 주겠어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B204BCF4B85CC11C0020C0C8B86DAC8C0020C0B4AE300020C704D574000ABAA9C228C7440020BD88C0ACB974B2940020BA54AC00C9C4D654B97C0020BCF4C5EC0020C8FCACA0C5B4002100100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "부탁하겠습니다, 무장조.\n저를 사나이로 만들어 주십쇼!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD80D0C1D558ACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002C0020BB34C7A5C870002E000AC800B97C0020C0ACB098C774B85C0020B9CCB4E4C5B40020C8FCC2EDC1FC002100100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지긴 했지만, 지프 씨에게\n저의 뜨거운 혼을 부딪칠 수 있었네요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0AE340020D588C9C0B9CC002C0020C9C0D5040020C528C5D0AC8C000AC800C7580020B728AC70C6B40020D63CC7440020BD80B52ACE600020C2180020C788C5C8B124C694002E00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지금 제 마음속에서\n요리사의 불꽃이 타오르는 것만 같습니다.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0AE080020C81C0020B9C8C74CC18DC5D0C11C000AC694B9ACC0ACC7580020BD88AF43C7740020D0C0C624B974B2940020AC83B9CC0020AC19C2B5B2C8B2E4002E00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래그래,\n이건 어울려 준 보답이야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798ADF8B798002C000AC774AC740020C5B4C6B8B8240020C9000020BCF4B2F5C774C57C002E00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ᤀ<U+0001> 다른 색의\n그리 코디 쿡 코트 세트를 손에 넣었다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100002190000010020B2E4B9780020C0C9C758000AADF8B9AC0020CF54B5140020CFE10020CF54D2B80020C138D2B8B97C0020C190C5D00020B123C5C8B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그리 같은 헤어스타일을 해 보는 것도\n괜찮지 않을까?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B9AC0020AC19C7400020D5E4C5B4C2A4D0C0C77CC7440020D5740020BCF4B2940020AC83B3C4000AAD1CCC2EC9C00020C54AC744AE4C003F00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋은 만남은 사람을\n좋은 방향으로 이끌어 주는 것 같네요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
